<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Storm Call</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 12)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast storm call</a>
</pre>
<p>You spread your arms and beckon the gods to send a violent storm. A cold wind 
chills everyone to the bone, and the weather of the whole area turns towards 
the worse: clouds, rain, and in time lightning. The stronger your spell, the 
faster it turns.
</p><p>It only works under the open sky: indoors, or anywhere without weather, 
nothing happens. Some spells need bad weather, call lightning above all. 
Clear skies does the opposite. It is also found on wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Weather</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Call Lightning</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clear Skies</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>